  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  subject: Final Cave
  context: If you're reading this, you've reached the final cave. I can hear them
    drawing closer, and there's no time left for me. The exit remains sealed until
    the dangers within are dealt with. Search the cave, face whatever lurks in the
    darkness, and find a way to escape. Don't stop moving. Whatever is down here
    won't wait forever, and you may be its next victim.
  logbookBook: {fileID: 0}
